# Debug artifacts
# 2026-07-29: the old broad "*_overlay.*" suffix rule below matched
# app/core/omr/debug_overlay.py by accident (filename ends in "_overlay.py")
# and silently excluded that real source file from git for who knows how
# long — engine.py's try/except ModuleNotFoundError fallback then quietly
# disabled ALL debug overlay image generation in production with zero error
# surfaced anywhere. These patterns are redundant anyway: the actual
# generated debug images live under backend/outputs/ and backend/uploads/,
# which are already ignored as whole directories above. Scoping remaining
# rules to image/json extensions (never .py) so this can't happen again.
calibrate_*.jpg
calibrate_*.png
auto_crop_test.*
no_crop_test.*

# App exports
Results_*.csv
scored*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls

# Logs
*.log
logs/

# Local debug scripts
backend/scripts/debug_*.py
backend/test_write.txt
